# 
In order to successfully intervene we need to understand how easily we can reach people with interventions like vaccine. 

##


```{r}
#| fig-width: 7
#| fig-height: 10

make_2_way_table(sexOrientation, demo_group) %>%
  make_grouped_radar_plot() %>%
